@startuml 03-modules
!theme plain
title Modular monolith — internal modules

package "Activity Ranking Service" {
  [graphql] as GQL
  [scoring] as Score
  [store] as Store
  [refresh] as Refresh
  [open-meteo] as OMClient
  [geocoding] as Geo
}

database "PostgreSQL" as PG
cloud "Open-Meteo" as OM

GQL --> Store : load location + forecast days
GQL --> Score : pure functions (no I/O)
GQL --> Geo : resolve name → candidates
Geo --> Store : geocode cache hit/miss
Geo --> OMClient : miss → geocode API
Refresh --> Store : list tracked locations\nidempotent upserts
Refresh --> OMClient : forecast fetch
Refresh --> Score : compute-on-read\n(no score table in v1)
OMClient --> OM : HTTP
Store --> PG : SQL via Prisma

note right of Score
  Deterministic, versioned rubric.
  Unit-testable without DB or HTTP.
end note

note right of GQL
  In-process: function calls.
  No network between modules.
end note

@enduml
